1
00:01:38,050 --> 00:01:43,050
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:43,570
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,570 --> 00:01:45,930
[Episode 9]

4
00:01:51,070 --> 00:01:51,870
What...

5
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,229
How could this have happened?

6
00:01:54,229 --> 00:01:55,430
He was tortured

7
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:57,430
and had no way of escaping on his own.

8
00:01:57,430 --> 00:01:59,009
Someone must have been behind this.

9
00:01:59,009 --> 00:02:00,230
It's no easy feat for an outsider

10
00:02:00,230 --> 00:02:01,280
to get into the Divine Constable Bureau,

11
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,120
let alone get someone out.

12
00:02:03,950 --> 00:02:04,760
Could there be

13
00:02:05,870 --> 00:02:08,270
a mole within the Divine Constable Bureau?

14
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,120
Investigate all personnel

15
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:12,280
in the bureau who were involved

16
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,470
in detaining Lou Tianming!

17
00:02:13,470 --> 00:02:14,130
Yes, Chief.

18
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:15,960
Who was the last person

19
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,120
to come into contact

20
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,180
with Lou Tianming?

21
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:19,520
Chief,

22
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,370
it was Eunuch Zhao
from the Eastern Palace.

23
00:02:21,370 --> 00:02:22,470
But I don't think it makes sense

24
00:02:22,470 --> 00:02:23,520
to say that Eunuch Zhao

25
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,750
did this.

26
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,910
You specifically ordered us

27
00:02:25,910 --> 00:02:27,120
to avoid any mistakes when someone

28
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,700
from the Eastern Palace
came for investigation.

29
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:29,560
So Ding Mao and I were

30
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:31,690
watching from the side the whole time.

31
00:02:31,740 --> 00:02:33,800
It's just that Eunuch Zhao was
too close to him

32
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:35,120
and almost got his ear bitten off,

33
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,430
and I stopped it. Other than that,

34
00:02:36,430 --> 00:02:37,760
nothing else happened.

35
00:02:39,690 --> 00:02:43,120
[Crown Prince's residence]

36
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,240
You silly servant!

37
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,360
Please spare me!

38
00:02:44,310 --> 00:02:45,400
Your Highness, I'm begging you!

39
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,470
Could you please stop hitting me?

40
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:48,370
The Court of Judicial Review
didn't interfere!

41
00:02:48,370 --> 00:02:50,030
Please spare me! I beg you!

42
00:02:50,030 --> 00:02:51,910
The Ministry of Justice
didn't dare to interfere!

43
00:02:51,910 --> 00:02:53,910
The Divine Constable Bureau was
also just watching!

44
00:02:53,910 --> 00:02:54,590
You...

45
00:02:54,710 --> 00:02:55,710
Only you!

46
00:02:56,710 --> 00:02:58,280
You thick-headed moron!

47
00:02:58,870 --> 00:03:01,030
You rushed to interrogate Lou Tianming,

48
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:02,750
and now he's escaped!

49
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,150
Your Highness!

50
00:03:06,470 --> 00:03:08,110
Lou Tianming's escape

51
00:03:08,130 --> 00:03:10,430
has absolutely nothing to do with me!

52
00:03:10,430 --> 00:03:11,190
Obviously!

53
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,860
Do you even have the brains for it?

54
00:03:15,150 --> 00:03:15,960
Now,

55
00:03:16,870 --> 00:03:18,870
only you approached Lou Tianming.

56
00:03:19,030 --> 00:03:21,310
Even if His Majesty doesn't blame me,

57
00:03:22,079 --> 00:03:25,120
in his heart, that bastard, Zhou Miao,

58
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,310
has one-upped me

59
00:03:27,310 --> 00:03:28,710
once again!

60
00:03:33,079 --> 00:03:34,000
Wait, Your Highness!

61
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:34,870
You can't get anything done.

62
00:03:34,870 --> 00:03:36,030
You're going to beat me to death!

63
00:03:36,030 --> 00:03:37,310
Yet you're great at ruining things!

64
00:03:37,310 --> 00:03:38,000
Please stop, Your Highness.

65
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,470
You silly servant!

66
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:47,980
Your Highness.

67
00:03:48,710 --> 00:03:51,770
Even if you want to punish your servant,
Your Highness,

68
00:03:53,900 --> 00:03:56,690
[Chu Huan'er, Crown Princess]

69
00:03:54,190 --> 00:03:56,840
you should still leave him some dignity.

70
00:03:58,630 --> 00:04:00,830
You shouldn't humiliate him in public.

71
00:04:06,710 --> 00:04:08,110
You are my wife,

72
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:10,630
the Crown Princess!

73
00:04:12,580 --> 00:04:13,630
You took the whip

74
00:04:13,630 --> 00:04:15,630
just to plead for a servant?

75
00:04:20,630 --> 00:04:22,430
You truly are the widely praised

76
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:24,690
virtuous Crown Princess in Tianhuang City.

77
00:04:24,690 --> 00:04:26,150
Virtuous Crown Princess!

78
00:04:29,130 --> 00:04:30,400
Everyone says

79
00:04:30,630 --> 00:04:31,630
that I, the Crown Prince, have never

80
00:04:31,630 --> 00:04:32,830
done anything good.

81
00:04:34,070 --> 00:04:36,360
But the only thing I did right

82
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,510
was

83
00:04:38,550 --> 00:04:40,370
marrying you.

84
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:42,060
Your Highness,

85
00:04:42,620 --> 00:04:44,080
they praise me too highly.

86
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,390
Your Highness!

87
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:47,510
It's all my fault!

88
00:04:47,510 --> 00:04:49,240
It's only right that you beat me!

89
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:51,070
Look at me! I have thick skin!

90
00:04:51,070 --> 00:04:52,180
You can hit me freely!

91
00:04:52,180 --> 00:04:54,360
But the Crown Princess is precious
and of noble birth!

92
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:56,070
If she gets hurt because of me,

93
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,560
even my death

94
00:04:57,560 --> 00:05:00,480
-can't make up for it, Your Highness!
-Your Highness,

95
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,390
considering all the years

96
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:03,720
Eunuch Zhao has taken good care

97
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:05,190
of our child, Ye'er,

98
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,950
please spare him this time.

99
00:05:19,830 --> 00:05:21,230
Sing from the beginning!

100
00:05:23,270 --> 00:05:26,560
Is there really a mole
in the Divine Constable Bureau?

101
00:05:30,030 --> 00:05:31,950
[Entry Records
of Divine Constable Bureau's Prison]

102
00:05:38,770 --> 00:05:40,050
[Entry Records
of Divine Constable Bureau's Prison]

103
00:05:40,180 --> 00:05:41,020
[Criminal, Wang, Mrs. Zhao]
[Crime: Cursed the officer with voodoo]

104
00:05:41,020 --> 00:05:41,870
[Punishment:
Confinement in the women's prison]

105
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,370
His Majesty has ordered

106
00:05:53,830 --> 00:05:56,040
the Divine Constable Bureau
to only imprison him,

107
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,440
but not interrogate him.

108
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,000
Who on earth

109
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,830
can enter and exit the dungeon freely

110
00:06:00,830 --> 00:06:02,490
without arousing suspicion?

111
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,540
Your Highness,

112
00:06:07,390 --> 00:06:11,190
Ye'er's condition hasn't taken a turn
for the better for a long time.

113
00:06:11,190 --> 00:06:12,000
I'd like

114
00:06:12,310 --> 00:06:14,630
to use my savings from over the years

115
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,460
to rebuild the Buddhist hall
in our mansion.

116
00:06:18,270 --> 00:06:19,940
I want to be more frugal myself,

117
00:06:19,940 --> 00:06:22,370
so I can accumulate more merit for Ye'er.

118
00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:26,410
Ye'er has been ill for a long time.

119
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,250
I think it must be...

120
00:06:28,250 --> 00:06:29,660
Do you mean that

121
00:06:31,190 --> 00:06:33,520
I, the Crown Prince, am immoral

122
00:06:33,550 --> 00:06:35,300
and devoid of dignity and conscience,

123
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:37,560
diminishing Ye'er's merit?

124
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,090
Listen,

125
00:06:39,110 --> 00:06:40,460
Ye'er's poor health

126
00:06:41,110 --> 00:06:42,430
is all your fault!

127
00:06:42,510 --> 00:06:44,720
I, the Crown Prince,
have a broad face and a fine jaw

128
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:46,240
and am full of vigor!

129
00:06:46,510 --> 00:06:48,570
That little brat you gave birth to

130
00:06:48,590 --> 00:06:51,070
is scrawny and sickly!

131
00:06:51,070 --> 00:06:52,390
How is he like me at all?

132
00:06:52,390 --> 00:06:53,250
Your Highness!

133
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:56,240
Ye'er is smart, wise,

134
00:06:56,390 --> 00:06:57,680
generous, kind, and virtuous.

135
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,560
How is he not like you?

136
00:06:59,590 --> 00:07:00,920
Cut the crap!

137
00:07:00,950 --> 00:07:01,600
Were it not for

138
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,680
your useless womb,

139
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,240
only giving birth to one child
in all these years,

140
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,040
would His Majesty let

141
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:07,070
Zhou Miao take charge
of the Ministry of Justice?

142
00:07:07,070 --> 00:07:08,480
He is coveting my position

143
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,480
as Crown Prince.

144
00:07:09,830 --> 00:07:11,240
This is all your fault.

145
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:13,200
You are a disaster,

146
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:14,830
the root of the problem.

147
00:07:15,070 --> 00:07:16,680
You were born a commoner!

148
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,720
Being able to marry me

149
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,600
is a favor

150
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:21,310
I bestowed upon you,

151
00:07:21,390 --> 00:07:24,250
thanks to the merit
accumulated by your ancestors!

152
00:07:32,830 --> 00:07:34,710
Go kneel in the Buddhist hall.

153
00:07:35,270 --> 00:07:37,480
Kneel for 6 hours first.

154
00:07:40,350 --> 00:07:41,680
Go now!

155
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,800
I suggest

156
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,480
that the truth of the black chest case

157
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,630
be made public.

158
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,000
The truth?

159
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:02,120
Can the truth make Northern Kun
withdraw their troops?

160
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,240
Can your truth

161
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,920
bring an extra 100,000 soldiers

162
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,600
or 100,000 provisions?

163
00:08:10,270 --> 00:08:12,870
The truth restores justice
in people's hearts

164
00:08:12,870 --> 00:08:14,680
and distinguishes right from wrong.

165
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:16,480
With justice on our side,
we will be confident.

166
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:19,240
With confidence, the army
and their commander will stay unbreakable.

167
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,870
Northern Kun used Wen Bu's death

168
00:08:20,870 --> 00:08:22,390
as an excuse for their southward invasion,

169
00:08:22,390 --> 00:08:24,040
with their army approaching Great Shi.

170
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,830
If we can prove

171
00:08:25,830 --> 00:08:27,240
that Wen Bu faked his death...

172
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:29,100
He has already turned into water.

173
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,360
How can we prove it?

174
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,630
What if we

175
00:08:34,390 --> 00:08:35,669
bring the real Wen Bu

176
00:08:35,669 --> 00:08:37,669
to the army?

177
00:08:41,909 --> 00:08:44,080
Wen Bu is in Great Shi?

178
00:08:44,860 --> 00:08:45,840
To fake

179
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,510
his death,

180
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,870
Wen Bu absolutely couldn't stay
in Northern Kun,

181
00:08:49,870 --> 00:08:50,670
and he wouldn't have

182
00:08:50,670 --> 00:08:52,140
too many people protecting him
by his side.

183
00:08:52,140 --> 00:08:53,930
As long as we find Wen Bu,

184
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:56,280
we can just break this deadlock.

185
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:03,200
Divine Constable Bureau,
deploy all members!

186
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,910
You must catch Wen Bu

187
00:09:04,910 --> 00:09:06,080
and Lou Tianming!

188
00:09:06,390 --> 00:09:07,200
-Understood!
-Understood!

189
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:07,310
[Chief Constable's Hall]

190
00:09:07,670 --> 00:09:08,670
The amount of the bounty

191
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:09,720
has been counted

192
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,080
according to the usual practice.

193
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:11,840
Anyone who provides

194
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,080
the whereabouts of Wen Bu and Lou Tianming

195
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,160
will be rewarded with 50 taels of silver.

196
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:15,480
500 taels of silver
for capturing the two wanted men.

197
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:17,240
Please sign and seal, My Lord, My Lady.

198
00:09:15,740 --> 00:09:16,030
[Special Notice
from the Divine Constable Bureau]

199
00:09:17,210 --> 00:09:18,070
[Wanted]

200
00:09:18,130 --> 00:09:19,620
[Tianhuang City]

201
00:09:18,510 --> 00:09:19,480
On land,

202
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:21,270
the Divine Constable Bureau
will use post horses

203
00:09:19,730 --> 00:09:21,140
[Wen Bu] [Lou Tiantian]

204
00:09:21,270 --> 00:09:22,870
to block every key post house in advance
and cut off

205
00:09:22,870 --> 00:09:24,270
-their access to horses and supplies.
-Take a look.

206
00:09:24,270 --> 00:09:25,510
Have you seen this person?

207
00:09:25,510 --> 00:09:26,400
No.

208
00:09:26,370 --> 00:09:29,920
[Proclamation]

209
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,480
By water,

210
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:29,030
we will use
the water vein tracking technique,

211
00:09:29,030 --> 00:09:29,790
relying on the current

212
00:09:29,790 --> 00:09:31,910
to spread news to downstream
fishing villages and ferries.

213
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:33,240
Fishermen who find the pills
and report to the authorities

214
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:35,040
will get their rewards of money.

215
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,390
Chief.

216
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,150
No clues.

217
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,750
It's been 3 days,

218
00:09:49,030 --> 00:09:50,480
and there is still no trace?

219
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,340
Could it be that

220
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:54,440
they have already
left the Great Shi territory?

221
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,440
Be patient.

222
00:09:56,030 --> 00:09:58,030
Maybe there will be a turning point.

223
00:09:58,270 --> 00:09:59,720
After all, our Divine Constable Bureau

224
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,120
is full of hidden talents,

225
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:03,050
each with their own unique skills.

226
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,120
Young Master,

227
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:12,870
I can't do anything about

228
00:10:12,870 --> 00:10:13,840
Constable Meng's injury.

229
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,270
Please

230
00:10:14,270 --> 00:10:15,870
don't call me over again.

231
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,240
I know.

232
00:10:17,630 --> 00:10:19,760
I'm not here to ask you to save Meng Rui.

233
00:10:25,700 --> 00:10:27,190
Let me see.

234
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,900
If you can't save Meng Rui,

235
00:10:30,270 --> 00:10:31,550
can you save this?

236
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:55,000
Lou Tianming, Lou Tianming.

237
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:56,270
You kept saying that

238
00:11:56,270 --> 00:11:58,240
your black chest plan was flawless

239
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:00,160
and would definitely kill Bai Qi

240
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:03,480
to eliminate a great threat
to Northern Kun's southern expedition.

241
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,390
And the result?

242
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,550
I also heard

243
00:12:06,570 --> 00:12:09,500
that you were caught
by the Divine Constable Bureau.

244
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,000
It seems that

245
00:12:12,870 --> 00:12:14,200
the Kingdom of Liluo and the demons

246
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:15,080
you mentioned

247
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,230
aren't that great.

248
00:12:20,750 --> 00:12:22,080
I've been traveling all the way

249
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:22,840
and finally

250
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,670
escaped the encirclement
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

251
00:12:24,670 --> 00:12:26,080
I'm really starving.

252
00:12:26,750 --> 00:12:28,600
I wonder if you, Prince Wenbu,

253
00:12:28,790 --> 00:12:31,000
could give me some food.

254
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:56,080
What a fine piece of meat.

255
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:59,000
It's a pity I'm not a beast.

256
00:12:59,620 --> 00:13:01,820
How could I eat raw meat and drink blood?

257
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:03,910
But you,

258
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:06,370
who sacrificed your subordinates

259
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:09,000
and disregarded the common people,

260
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:13,000
truly deserve the word "beast."

261
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,200
What did you say?

262
00:13:28,390 --> 00:13:30,600
We once met
at the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

263
00:13:30,600 --> 00:13:32,750
You are Young Master Qingyang, Li Si.

264
00:13:33,150 --> 00:13:35,290
A powerful master like Yan Zige

265
00:13:35,670 --> 00:13:37,720
served you and died for you.

266
00:13:38,350 --> 00:13:40,310
Calling you a beast just now

267
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:41,940
is an insult to beasts.

268
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:44,560
Beasts don't harm their own kind.

269
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:45,720
But you do.

270
00:13:47,750 --> 00:13:50,320
How dare Lou Tianming betray me!

271
00:13:50,790 --> 00:13:51,600
You're wrong.

272
00:13:52,750 --> 00:13:55,550
Lou Tianming didn't say anything.

273
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,360
It was just my guess.

274
00:13:57,630 --> 00:14:00,080
For Lou Tianming to establish contact

275
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:01,480
with you, Your Highness,

276
00:14:01,790 --> 00:14:02,670
he must have used

277
00:14:02,670 --> 00:14:04,270
something to send messages.

278
00:14:04,790 --> 00:14:06,240
The carrier pigeons
of the Divine Constable Bureau

279
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:08,000
are all recorded when they come and go.

280
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:10,060
Lou Tianming wouldn't dare use them.

281
00:14:10,730 --> 00:14:12,190
So I guessed...

282
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,000
What he used

283
00:14:16,390 --> 00:14:18,200
must be his falcon.

284
00:14:20,870 --> 00:14:22,600
The night the demons attacked,

285
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:24,720
it happened to fall right at my feet.

286
00:14:25,550 --> 00:14:28,150
I asked a doctor to heal it.

287
00:14:28,790 --> 00:14:31,240
I trained it a bit

288
00:14:31,630 --> 00:14:32,670
and followed it.

289
00:14:33,390 --> 00:14:34,320
It naturally

290
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:35,390
led me here.

291
00:14:43,340 --> 00:14:44,740
Your Highness,

292
00:14:46,510 --> 00:14:47,860
don't worry.

293
00:14:48,630 --> 00:14:50,910
I am just a trainee constable

294
00:14:50,910 --> 00:14:52,640
of the Divine Constable Bureau

295
00:14:52,790 --> 00:14:54,790
with no authority to deploy people.

296
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:56,390
I came here

297
00:14:57,030 --> 00:14:58,550
alone.

298
00:15:08,150 --> 00:15:09,390
In this case,

299
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:11,720
what can you do to me by yourself?

300
00:15:37,630 --> 00:15:39,960
The 6 ancient gods of Liluo—

301
00:15:40,670 --> 00:15:44,480
Immortality, Prophecy, Lies,

302
00:15:41,410 --> 00:15:44,250
[God of Prophecy, Rangnan]

303
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:49,390
Hatred, Disaster, and Death.

304
00:15:51,630 --> 00:15:54,290
Now that the mystery
of the black chest is solved

305
00:15:54,760 --> 00:15:57,820
and the God of Prophecy
has finally fallen,

306
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:02,240
cheer, rejoice,

307
00:16:02,550 --> 00:16:04,820
and turn a blind eye.

308
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:09,630
This is my gift to Great Shi.

309
00:16:10,490 --> 00:16:13,330
I hope you like it.

310
00:16:14,700 --> 00:16:16,050
Your Majesty,

311
00:16:16,150 --> 00:16:18,120
Wenbu has confessed everything.

312
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:19,440
Behind Lou Tianming,

313
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:21,030
there is a mysterious organization

314
00:16:21,030 --> 00:16:22,290
called the Dark Night.

315
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,960
Its members are all

316
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:26,210
formidable killers
who are neither human nor ghost.

317
00:16:26,210 --> 00:16:27,320
The Dark Night?

318
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:31,060
What does the Dark Night stand to gain

319
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:33,160
by conspiring with Northern Kun

320
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:37,200
against our Great Shi?

321
00:16:37,550 --> 00:16:39,150
All members of the Dark Night

322
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:41,670
swear allegiance to Liluo.

323
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:46,500
In the third year of Zhengwu's reign,

324
00:16:47,380 --> 00:16:50,060
the late Emperor Wuzong of Shi
wiped out Liluo.

325
00:16:51,630 --> 00:16:52,630
Who would have thought

326
00:16:52,630 --> 00:16:54,240
that decades later,

327
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:57,140
these remnants of Liluo

328
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:59,790
would still be plotting a rebellion?

329
00:17:02,030 --> 00:17:04,720
That's all Wenbu knows.

330
00:17:05,069 --> 00:17:06,829
I've sent him to the Envoy Residence

331
00:17:06,829 --> 00:17:08,000
and placed him under strict guard.

332
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,640
He awaits Your Majesty's judgment.

333
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:11,550
I ordered you to capture Meng Rui

334
00:17:11,550 --> 00:17:13,109
and give me an explanation.

335
00:17:13,349 --> 00:17:14,160
Yet you

336
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:16,230
brought me news

337
00:17:16,230 --> 00:17:17,960
of the people of Liluo instead.

338
00:17:20,270 --> 00:17:21,790
You did well.

339
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:24,270
But, Shan,

340
00:17:25,589 --> 00:17:26,750
this is the first time

341
00:17:26,750 --> 00:17:28,480
you've gone against my wishes.

342
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:32,510
Meng Rui is neither kin nor friend to you.

343
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:34,880
Why are you protecting him so fiercely?

344
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:36,480
What I protect

345
00:17:37,070 --> 00:17:38,350
is not Meng Rui,

346
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:40,680
but justice and righteousness,

347
00:17:41,270 --> 00:17:43,070
the truth and public sentiment.

348
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:52,110
Years ago, I told your sister

349
00:17:52,790 --> 00:17:54,920
that I could find you a good match.

350
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:57,240
Among all the court officials,

351
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:59,000
royal relatives and nobles,

352
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:00,840
you could take your pick.

353
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:04,760
Why bring this up
all of a sudden, Your Majesty?

354
00:18:06,270 --> 00:18:07,880
You refused at the time.

355
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:09,790
You said,

356
00:18:10,270 --> 00:18:12,830
since your sister had already
married into the royal family,

357
00:18:12,830 --> 00:18:13,640
then

358
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:16,530
you wished only to
serve the court faithfully

359
00:18:16,590 --> 00:18:19,590
and insisted on joining
the Divine Constable Bureau.

360
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,920
I hesitated then.

361
00:18:23,030 --> 00:18:23,960
Do you know

362
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:26,510
why I hesitated?

363
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:31,010
The Divine Constable Bureau
stands outside the Six Ministries.

364
00:18:31,010 --> 00:18:33,010
It is Your Majesty's eyes and hands.

365
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:35,830
But my elder sister was already Empress,

366
00:18:35,830 --> 00:18:37,230
ruling the inner palace.

367
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:40,200
If I became Chief Commissioner as well,

368
00:18:41,750 --> 00:18:43,680
then the Xuanyuan family might...

369
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:48,680
might be suspected of
abusing its power as imperial in-laws.

370
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:50,750
So I made you swear an oath.

371
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:53,550
If you joined the Divine Constable Bureau,

372
00:18:53,550 --> 00:18:55,590
you could never marry in your lifetime,

373
00:18:55,590 --> 00:18:56,750
nor have children.

374
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:59,400
Because the position of Chief Commissioner

375
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:00,350
of the Divine Constable Bureau

376
00:19:00,350 --> 00:19:02,080
allows no personal interests.

377
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:05,270
The only family
you could have in this lifetime

378
00:19:05,270 --> 00:19:06,550
would be me.

379
00:19:11,590 --> 00:19:13,750
I understand, Your Majesty.

380
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:17,030
Investigate Liluo and Lou Tianming

381
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:17,960
together.

382
00:19:19,550 --> 00:19:21,960
The Divine Constable Bureau
is heavily guarded.

383
00:19:21,960 --> 00:19:23,400
Without an insider,

384
00:19:24,500 --> 00:19:26,190
how could they have escaped?

385
00:19:28,350 --> 00:19:29,160
Yes, Your Majesty.

386
00:19:29,060 --> 00:19:31,790
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

387
00:19:40,600 --> 00:19:42,200
This is truly divine nectar.

388
00:19:52,070 --> 00:19:53,050
You forcibly activated

389
00:19:53,050 --> 00:19:54,640
the Soaring Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation,

390
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:56,590
and you're suffering
internal injuries too.

391
00:19:56,590 --> 00:19:58,240
Yet you still want to drink?

392
00:19:58,790 --> 00:19:59,990
Are you trying to die?

393
00:20:05,550 --> 00:20:07,000
These past few days, Tianhuang City

394
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:08,480
has been searching
for Meng Rui everywhere.

395
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:09,440
Looks like the Emperor,

396
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:10,790
regardless of the truth,

397
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:12,390
is determined to use Meng Rui

398
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:14,740
to give Northern Kun an explanation.

399
00:20:16,030 --> 00:20:17,240
This scene

400
00:20:17,790 --> 00:20:19,590
is just like 17 years ago.

401
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:28,680
Do you happen to know

402
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:30,160
where Meng Rui is?

403
00:20:32,030 --> 00:20:32,790
What?

404
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:35,510
You won't even tell your own master?

405
00:20:39,650 --> 00:20:42,060
I don't want to know anyway.

406
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:43,210
Seriously.

407
00:20:46,550 --> 00:20:48,400
Using the investigation as an excuse,

408
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,270
you've met

409
00:20:49,270 --> 00:20:50,600
Zhou Miao and Zhou Tiao.

410
00:20:51,030 --> 00:20:51,790
How is it?

411
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:53,790
Did you find anything?

412
00:21:04,030 --> 00:21:05,230
Seventeen years ago,

413
00:21:05,270 --> 00:21:07,240
Big Brother falsely reported
a military emergency

414
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,350
to lure Father away

415
00:21:09,350 --> 00:21:11,030
and then notified Second Brother.

416
00:21:11,030 --> 00:21:13,720
The two of them conspired together

417
00:21:14,790 --> 00:21:17,590
and tried to kill me
at Mulan Hunting Grounds.

418
00:21:18,790 --> 00:21:19,790
After I died,

419
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:21,400
Father learned about

420
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:23,170
the false military report.

421
00:21:25,400 --> 00:21:27,260
Big Brother took responsibility

422
00:21:27,300 --> 00:21:30,440
and voluntarily gave up
his position in the Ministry of War.

423
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:31,880
He also had everyone

424
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:34,100
in the Ministry of War who knew the truth

425
00:21:34,100 --> 00:21:35,390
silenced.

426
00:21:38,070 --> 00:21:39,130
If that's the case,

427
00:21:39,530 --> 00:21:41,060
what are you planning to do?

428
00:21:46,250 --> 00:21:47,450
I know Father well.

429
00:21:48,700 --> 00:21:49,900
Seventeen years ago,

430
00:21:50,380 --> 00:21:51,650
he buried the truth

431
00:21:52,350 --> 00:21:54,320
and chose not to pursue
Big Brother or Second Brother.

432
00:21:54,320 --> 00:21:55,390
That shows

433
00:21:57,680 --> 00:21:59,380
that in his heart,

434
00:21:59,960 --> 00:22:02,490
he cares only about
keeping the court stable.

435
00:22:03,290 --> 00:22:05,050
If you truly wanted revenge,

436
00:22:05,150 --> 00:22:06,380
seventeen years ago,

437
00:22:06,930 --> 00:22:08,730
you could have gone straight

438
00:22:08,870 --> 00:22:10,410
to your father,
regardless of the consequences.

439
00:22:10,410 --> 00:22:11,680
At least you could have

440
00:22:11,710 --> 00:22:13,310
forced a lose-lose outcome.

441
00:22:13,540 --> 00:22:14,670
But you didn't.

442
00:22:20,440 --> 00:22:21,240
Now,

443
00:22:21,880 --> 00:22:23,480
what else can I do

444
00:22:23,500 --> 00:22:25,630
besides secretly gathering evidence

445
00:22:26,200 --> 00:22:28,060
and waiting for the right moment?

446
00:22:28,750 --> 00:22:31,000
There's just one thing

447
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:34,400
I need to investigate at Tianshu Pavilion.

448
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:38,260
Mr. Meng

449
00:22:38,280 --> 00:22:40,000
really had a brush with death this time.

450
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:40,510
Meng Rui!

451
00:22:40,510 --> 00:22:41,200
Who is that?

452
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:41,790
Little Ice Cube.

453
00:22:41,790 --> 00:22:42,310
Mr. Yan.

454
00:22:42,310 --> 00:22:42,760
Where is he?

455
00:22:42,760 --> 00:22:43,960
-Mr. Yan.
-Mr. Yan.

456
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:45,280
This...

457
00:22:46,500 --> 00:22:48,120
What happened, Zhenzhu?

458
00:22:48,190 --> 00:22:49,450
Li Si brought him back.

459
00:22:51,050 --> 00:22:52,990
Turns out he was the one who hid him.

460
00:22:53,020 --> 00:22:54,110
Tao, how is he?

461
00:22:54,400 --> 00:22:56,010
I can only say I'll do my best.

462
00:22:56,030 --> 00:22:56,820
What do you mean, "do your best"?

463
00:22:56,820 --> 00:22:58,040
You have to heal him!

464
00:22:58,400 --> 00:22:59,200
Yes.

465
00:22:59,770 --> 00:23:00,600
Where's Qingyang?

466
00:23:00,600 --> 00:23:03,000
He left after getting everything settled.

467
00:23:03,360 --> 00:23:05,020
How did he get hurt this badly?

468
00:23:11,260 --> 00:23:14,910
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

469
00:24:07,610 --> 00:24:09,010
Whether he pulls through

470
00:24:09,500 --> 00:24:11,630
will depend on the next couple of days.

471
00:24:18,010 --> 00:24:20,360
Brother, your kite is so high!

472
00:24:20,380 --> 00:24:21,880
Higher, please!

473
00:24:21,880 --> 00:24:22,550
Okay.

474
00:24:23,110 --> 00:24:24,550
Higher, please!

475
00:24:25,350 --> 00:24:26,880
Brother, higher!

476
00:24:26,900 --> 00:24:28,100
Higher!

477
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:30,150
-A little higher!
-Okay.

478
00:24:31,070 --> 00:24:32,110
Higher!

479
00:24:32,790 --> 00:24:33,590
Mother!

480
00:24:33,590 --> 00:24:34,030
Come on.

481
00:24:34,030 --> 00:24:35,260
Look.

482
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:36,580
It's so high!

483
00:24:36,780 --> 00:24:37,980
Father!

484
00:24:42,450 --> 00:24:43,250
Come quickly!

485
00:24:44,200 --> 00:24:45,000
I'm coming.

486
00:24:45,200 --> 00:24:46,130
It's beautiful.

487
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:07,270
We're back.

488
00:25:08,590 --> 00:25:10,400
Look, all these tonics.

489
00:25:10,600 --> 00:25:11,400
Qingyang,

490
00:25:11,560 --> 00:25:12,690
thank you for paying

491
00:25:12,720 --> 00:25:13,750
for Meng Rui's medicine.

492
00:25:13,750 --> 00:25:14,550
I appreciate your help, Yan.

493
00:25:14,550 --> 00:25:15,370
It's no trouble.

494
00:25:15,370 --> 00:25:16,030
Put them down.

495
00:25:16,030 --> 00:25:16,600
Okay.

496
00:25:16,620 --> 00:25:17,290
Tao,

497
00:25:17,840 --> 00:25:19,110
we have Lingzhi mushrooms
from Haisong Mountain

498
00:25:19,110 --> 00:25:20,970
that are over a hundred years old,

499
00:25:21,080 --> 00:25:22,810
as well as snow-grown Cordyceps,

500
00:25:22,810 --> 00:25:23,990
Chonghua snow lotus,

501
00:25:23,990 --> 00:25:26,670
Polygonatum, dragon's blood,
and white-banded snake.

502
00:25:26,670 --> 00:25:27,470
Take a look

503
00:25:27,830 --> 00:25:28,510
and see if there's anything

504
00:25:28,510 --> 00:25:29,720
that might be useful.

505
00:25:39,920 --> 00:25:41,070
Why aren't you saying anything?

506
00:25:41,070 --> 00:25:42,600
What's wrong with Meng Rui?

507
00:25:43,110 --> 00:25:45,110
His condition is stable for now,

508
00:25:46,110 --> 00:25:47,550
but strangely,

509
00:25:49,030 --> 00:25:50,000
he seems to be

510
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:51,730
in a deep sleep, lost in a dream.

511
00:25:52,110 --> 00:25:53,040
And what's more,

512
00:25:53,400 --> 00:25:55,200
he doesn't even want to wake up.

513
00:25:59,890 --> 00:26:00,680
Ms. Bai,

514
00:26:01,030 --> 00:26:02,160
you're a physician.

515
00:26:02,510 --> 00:26:04,440
You should understand what I mean.

516
00:26:06,170 --> 00:26:07,610
Whether he wakes up

517
00:26:08,050 --> 00:26:09,820
depends on whether he wants to.

518
00:26:09,850 --> 00:26:11,110
Wait. What do you mean?

519
00:26:12,720 --> 00:26:13,840
I've heard of cases

520
00:26:14,360 --> 00:26:15,470
like this.

521
00:26:16,090 --> 00:26:17,050
When someone

522
00:26:17,570 --> 00:26:19,830
has been through a great deal of tragedy,

523
00:26:20,200 --> 00:26:23,000
if they're strong-minded
in their everyday life,

524
00:26:23,280 --> 00:26:25,210
they may become unafraid of death.

525
00:26:25,580 --> 00:26:28,440
But once someone like that
suffers a serious injury

526
00:26:28,460 --> 00:26:30,390
and can no longer remain rational,

527
00:26:30,960 --> 00:26:32,610
the will to live within them

528
00:26:32,820 --> 00:26:34,020
can easily fade away.

529
00:26:34,780 --> 00:26:35,950
Simply put,

530
00:26:36,420 --> 00:26:38,620
he doesn't even want to live anymore.

531
00:26:41,350 --> 00:26:42,160
I wonder what Mr. Meng

532
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:43,490
must have been through.

533
00:26:43,570 --> 00:26:44,640
Wait. You mean

534
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:46,440
he doesn't want to live anymore?

535
00:26:46,510 --> 00:26:47,510
But why?

536
00:26:55,960 --> 00:26:56,960
In this world,

537
00:26:57,530 --> 00:26:59,190
there are indeed many things,

538
00:26:59,500 --> 00:27:00,560
many experiences,

539
00:27:01,360 --> 00:27:03,820
that can make someone
no longer want to live,

540
00:27:04,000 --> 00:27:06,260
that can make life feel worse than death.

541
00:27:30,160 --> 00:27:31,220
Mr. Meng,

542
00:27:32,200 --> 00:27:33,350
you have to hold on.

543
00:27:35,890 --> 00:27:36,840
I believe

544
00:27:37,330 --> 00:27:39,150
you wouldn't want this sword

545
00:27:39,910 --> 00:27:41,840
to fall silent forever, would you?

546
00:27:59,140 --> 00:28:03,790
[Severe-Cold]

547
00:28:11,510 --> 00:28:13,940
Brother, your kite is so high!

548
00:28:13,970 --> 00:28:15,340
Higher!

549
00:28:15,910 --> 00:28:17,390
Higher!

550
00:28:27,760 --> 00:28:28,760
Brother!

551
00:28:46,510 --> 00:28:48,270
Don't touch my sword.

552
00:28:48,770 --> 00:28:49,570
Meng Rui.

553
00:28:49,770 --> 00:28:50,450
He's awake.

554
00:28:50,470 --> 00:28:51,230
Meng!

555
00:28:51,260 --> 00:28:52,440
Meng is awake!

556
00:28:53,940 --> 00:28:55,210
-Meng.
-Meng is awake!

557
00:28:55,270 --> 00:28:56,350
-Meng.
-Meng is awake!

558
00:28:56,350 --> 00:28:57,500
Meng is awake.

559
00:28:57,550 --> 00:28:58,350
Meng!

560
00:28:58,920 --> 00:28:59,550
Meng Rui!

561
00:29:00,620 --> 00:29:02,570
[Severe-Cold]

562
00:29:04,030 --> 00:29:05,210
Meng is awake!

563
00:29:05,310 --> 00:29:06,270
Meng is awake!

564
00:29:06,270 --> 00:29:07,750
- Meng is awake!
- Really? That's great!

565
00:29:07,750 --> 00:29:08,720
Lord Constable Ghost is awake!

566
00:29:08,720 --> 00:29:09,880
Jiang Zhan, hurry!

567
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:11,750
Meng is awake!

568
00:29:11,790 --> 00:29:13,440
Mr. Meng is awake? That's wonderful!

569
00:29:11,820 --> 00:29:13,330
[Chief Constable's Hall]

570
00:29:13,440 --> 00:29:14,310
Chief!

571
00:29:14,920 --> 00:29:16,100
Chief!

572
00:29:17,290 --> 00:29:18,260
Reporting, Chief.

573
00:29:18,260 --> 00:29:19,400
Meng is awake!

574
00:29:32,850 --> 00:29:34,270
- Meng!
- Meng!

575
00:29:34,640 --> 00:29:35,240
Meng!

576
00:29:35,240 --> 00:29:35,960
- You're not fully recovered yet.
- Meng!

577
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:36,680
- You can't go!
- Meng!

578
00:29:36,680 --> 00:29:37,680
I have to go.

579
00:29:37,680 --> 00:29:38,680
Stay right there!

580
00:29:39,840 --> 00:29:41,570
You were only well for two days.

581
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:43,310
What are you up to now?

582
00:29:44,830 --> 00:29:46,090
I need to see the Chief.

583
00:29:46,410 --> 00:29:47,870
Why can't you just behave?

584
00:29:55,330 --> 00:29:57,240
The Chief went to see His Majesty

585
00:29:57,350 --> 00:29:58,640
and hasn't returned yet.

586
00:29:58,640 --> 00:29:59,880
If I were you,

587
00:30:00,350 --> 00:30:02,160
I'd stay put

588
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:03,560
and get some proper rest.

589
00:30:03,590 --> 00:30:04,400
After all,

590
00:30:04,910 --> 00:30:07,800
there's no need to rush.

591
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:10,700
The Liluo Night Demons are running wild.

592
00:30:10,700 --> 00:30:12,110
How can I rest easy?

593
00:30:12,110 --> 00:30:13,400
You just crawled back

594
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:13,960
from hell,

595
00:30:13,960 --> 00:30:15,030
so don't push your luck.

596
00:30:15,030 --> 00:30:15,830
What?

597
00:30:16,260 --> 00:30:17,350
You think the Divine Constable Bureau

598
00:30:17,350 --> 00:30:18,880
can't get by without you?

599
00:30:20,240 --> 00:30:21,030
Yan,

600
00:30:21,050 --> 00:30:22,070
that's just how Meng Rui is.

601
00:30:22,070 --> 00:30:23,600
You should know that by now.

602
00:30:26,090 --> 00:30:27,260
Where are you going?

603
00:30:27,630 --> 00:30:28,740
Physician Tao said

604
00:30:28,760 --> 00:30:30,450
Mr. Meng mustn't move around yet.

605
00:30:30,450 --> 00:30:31,880
Carry him to the sedan chair!

606
00:30:31,880 --> 00:30:32,590
Do you hear that?

607
00:30:32,590 --> 00:30:32,830
Understood.

608
00:30:32,830 --> 00:30:34,070
Get him out of here!

609
00:30:34,070 --> 00:30:34,510
Hurry!

610
00:30:34,510 --> 00:30:35,110
Please, Meng.

611
00:30:35,110 --> 00:30:35,770
Let go of me!

612
00:30:35,770 --> 00:30:36,690
Sit still!

613
00:30:36,850 --> 00:30:38,890
Just sit back and relax.

614
00:30:38,910 --> 00:30:39,670
Lord Yan,

615
00:30:39,750 --> 00:30:40,940
look after Lord Meng.

616
00:30:40,940 --> 00:30:42,380
Leave him to me.

617
00:30:42,440 --> 00:30:43,640
Lift the sedan chair!

618
00:30:44,260 --> 00:30:45,960
You little rascal. Got you now!

619
00:30:45,960 --> 00:30:46,720
Put me down!

620
00:30:46,750 --> 00:30:48,210
Yan, I need to see the Chief!

621
00:30:48,210 --> 00:30:50,420
- You will.
- Mr. Meng, don't worry.

622
00:30:50,750 --> 00:30:52,310
We'll get you home

623
00:30:52,310 --> 00:30:53,030
safe and sound.

624
00:30:53,030 --> 00:30:53,830
You got it!

625
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:54,750
Li Si!

626
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:08,120
- Grand Secretary Bai.
- Grand Secretary Bai.

627
00:31:08,120 --> 00:31:10,040
[Chief Constable's Hall]

628
00:31:11,830 --> 00:31:12,640
Father?

629
00:31:13,790 --> 00:31:14,590
Zhenzhu.

630
00:31:15,550 --> 00:31:16,680
What brings you here?

631
00:31:16,680 --> 00:31:18,150
You could've told me first.

632
00:31:18,150 --> 00:31:20,140
I'm the Prime Minister, after all.

633
00:31:20,170 --> 00:31:21,510
Am I not allowed to visit?

634
00:31:21,330 --> 00:31:23,290
[Head Constable's Hall]

635
00:31:21,960 --> 00:31:22,830
Besides,

636
00:31:22,830 --> 00:31:23,480
I'm your father.

637
00:31:23,480 --> 00:31:25,240
Isn't it only natural to visit

638
00:31:25,240 --> 00:31:26,510
my daughter's workplace?

639
00:31:26,130 --> 00:31:28,610
[Head Constable's Hall]

640
00:31:26,680 --> 00:31:27,480
Yes.

641
00:31:28,740 --> 00:31:31,150
[Pillar of the Realm]

642
00:31:31,160 --> 00:31:32,720
Father, have some tea.

643
00:31:33,790 --> 00:31:35,520
Did you need something from me?

644
00:31:36,830 --> 00:31:37,590
Zhenzhu,

645
00:31:37,590 --> 00:31:38,750
I had this sachet custom-made

646
00:31:38,750 --> 00:31:39,640
for you.

647
00:31:39,880 --> 00:31:40,680
Look,

648
00:31:40,830 --> 00:31:42,880
aren't the pearls on it beautiful?

649
00:31:42,900 --> 00:31:43,690
Here.

650
00:31:43,720 --> 00:31:44,810
Come on, take it.

651
00:31:46,680 --> 00:31:47,480
Father,

652
00:31:47,820 --> 00:31:49,710
I don't really use these.

653
00:31:50,090 --> 00:31:51,830
It contains precious spices

654
00:31:51,830 --> 00:31:53,290
from the Western Regions.

655
00:31:53,780 --> 00:31:56,090
Its rich fragrance lasts all year.

656
00:31:56,120 --> 00:31:57,410
You're a young woman,

657
00:31:57,430 --> 00:31:59,130
dealing with corpses every day.

658
00:31:59,130 --> 00:32:00,960
You should take better care of yourself.

659
00:32:00,960 --> 00:32:02,200
Come on, take it.

660
00:32:02,480 --> 00:32:03,280
Be a good girl.

661
00:32:03,960 --> 00:32:04,750
Father.

662
00:32:05,480 --> 00:32:06,160
Your daughter

663
00:32:06,160 --> 00:32:07,990
isn't like those rich young ladies.

664
00:32:07,990 --> 00:32:09,910
Besides, this is official business.

665
00:32:09,910 --> 00:32:11,640
All you ever care about is work.

666
00:32:12,530 --> 00:32:13,480
Zhenzhu,

667
00:32:13,510 --> 00:32:15,220
why don't you come home with me?

668
00:32:15,220 --> 00:32:16,950
You're already twenty-three.

669
00:32:17,010 --> 00:32:18,620
It's time you got married.

670
00:32:19,160 --> 00:32:19,960
Father.

671
00:32:20,070 --> 00:32:20,680
Can't you

672
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:22,340
stop making decisions for me?

673
00:32:24,830 --> 00:32:26,100
It's all Xuanyuan's fault

674
00:32:26,100 --> 00:32:27,610
for taking such a liking to you!

675
00:32:27,610 --> 00:32:28,960
I'd say

676
00:32:28,960 --> 00:32:30,580
your Bureau got quite a bargain!

677
00:32:30,580 --> 00:32:31,970
How can you say that?

678
00:32:31,990 --> 00:32:32,510
The Bureau

679
00:32:32,510 --> 00:32:33,480
pays me a salary, too,

680
00:32:33,480 --> 00:32:33,960
you know.

681
00:32:33,960 --> 00:32:35,480
With that meager salary of yours,

682
00:32:35,480 --> 00:32:37,350
you'd rather stretch every coin

683
00:32:37,350 --> 00:32:38,500
than take money from home.

684
00:32:38,500 --> 00:32:40,230
Does our money burn your hands?

685
00:32:40,270 --> 00:32:41,270
My money, my rules.

686
00:32:41,270 --> 00:32:42,330
I'm happy that way.

687
00:32:51,480 --> 00:32:52,270
Father.

688
00:32:52,960 --> 00:32:54,270
You can rest assured.

689
00:32:54,350 --> 00:32:56,110
I can take care of myself.

690
00:32:56,390 --> 00:32:57,590
Don't worry about me.

691
00:33:02,270 --> 00:33:03,070
All right.

692
00:33:03,830 --> 00:33:06,270
It's time I headed back.

693
00:33:08,070 --> 00:33:08,830
Father!

694
00:33:11,730 --> 00:33:12,780
Take this back.

695
00:33:12,810 --> 00:33:14,070
I really don't need it.

696
00:33:23,120 --> 00:33:26,490
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

697
00:33:30,330 --> 00:33:31,330
Master is here.

698
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:48,880
You two may leave.

699
00:33:49,060 --> 00:33:49,860
Yes, sir.

700
00:33:51,420 --> 00:33:53,350
Sorry to keep you waiting, Ms. Bai.

701
00:33:55,850 --> 00:33:57,880
This must be your first time

702
00:33:57,910 --> 00:34:00,110
dining at my Star-Gathering Pavilion.

703
00:34:00,270 --> 00:34:01,340
I've investigated cases here,

704
00:34:01,340 --> 00:34:03,130
but never dined here before.

705
00:34:07,260 --> 00:34:08,830
You saved my father, Lord Li.

706
00:34:08,830 --> 00:34:10,540
So it's only right

707
00:34:10,690 --> 00:34:12,290
that I treat you to this meal.

708
00:34:20,590 --> 00:34:21,400
Please, sit.

709
00:34:25,730 --> 00:34:26,600
Ms. Bai,

710
00:34:29,320 --> 00:34:31,710
no need for formalities.

711
00:34:31,730 --> 00:34:33,370
Just call me by my name.

712
00:34:33,590 --> 00:34:34,770
Calling me "Lord"

713
00:34:34,800 --> 00:34:36,110
seems a bit too formal.

714
00:34:43,560 --> 00:34:45,960
There's something

715
00:34:46,670 --> 00:34:48,270
I've been meaning to ask you.

716
00:34:49,989 --> 00:34:51,030
Go ahead, Ms. Bai.

717
00:34:52,050 --> 00:34:53,219
May I ask, Master Li,

718
00:34:53,620 --> 00:34:55,280
what's your true background?

719
00:35:01,430 --> 00:35:02,470
I suspect

720
00:35:03,370 --> 00:35:04,860
you're not the only one

721
00:35:05,710 --> 00:35:06,800
in our bureau

722
00:35:06,800 --> 00:35:08,060
who's been wondering.

723
00:35:18,580 --> 00:35:21,740
Have you ever played Go?

724
00:35:25,840 --> 00:35:27,110
I'm like

725
00:35:27,510 --> 00:35:28,800
a piece

726
00:35:28,800 --> 00:35:29,920
on a Go board.

727
00:35:33,860 --> 00:35:35,790
I once occupied the central point.

728
00:35:36,010 --> 00:35:37,350
The pieces on all sides

729
00:35:37,850 --> 00:35:39,450
seemed to pay me due respect,

730
00:35:39,780 --> 00:35:43,290
but were secretly plotting to kill me.

731
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:46,280
How could you respond?

732
00:35:50,580 --> 00:35:51,870
It's a chained ko.

733
00:35:52,830 --> 00:35:54,830
If two opposing pieces join forces,

734
00:35:55,050 --> 00:35:56,580
I have no chance of winning.

735
00:36:02,280 --> 00:36:03,070
Besides,

736
00:36:04,080 --> 00:36:05,000
I'm nothing more

737
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:06,330
than a mere chess piece.

738
00:36:07,240 --> 00:36:09,220
The player doesn't care

739
00:36:09,920 --> 00:36:12,130
what becomes of a single piece.

740
00:36:13,580 --> 00:36:14,820
So it seems

741
00:36:15,530 --> 00:36:16,990
you're a sacrificed pawn.

742
00:36:18,100 --> 00:36:19,180
That's right.

743
00:36:21,710 --> 00:36:27,740
[Wind and Moon]

744
00:36:25,630 --> 00:36:27,320
Look at your vast estate,

745
00:36:28,300 --> 00:36:30,430
not to mention your wisdom and skills.

746
00:36:30,760 --> 00:36:32,560
You claim to be a discarded pawn?

747
00:36:32,710 --> 00:36:33,770
I don't believe it.

748
00:36:41,310 --> 00:36:44,230
You're wrong, Ms. Bai.

749
00:36:45,350 --> 00:36:46,610
Even a discarded piece

750
00:36:47,020 --> 00:36:48,670
has its purpose.

751
00:36:51,910 --> 00:36:52,730
In the hands

752
00:36:52,760 --> 00:36:54,830
of someone cunning and unpredictable,

753
00:36:54,830 --> 00:36:57,870
even a discarded piece
can become a killing piece.

754
00:37:01,810 --> 00:37:03,640
The man you see before you

755
00:37:04,270 --> 00:37:06,500
is one who can crush all opposition.

756
00:37:08,160 --> 00:37:09,440
But in the end,

757
00:37:10,040 --> 00:37:11,260
win or lose,

758
00:37:11,290 --> 00:37:12,890
it's all just a game of chess.

759
00:37:13,290 --> 00:37:15,130
Whether you're a sacrificed piece

760
00:37:15,130 --> 00:37:16,820
doesn't really matter.

761
00:37:16,850 --> 00:37:18,880
But what if the game is big enough

762
00:37:21,070 --> 00:37:23,240
to encompass an entire world?

763
00:37:23,730 --> 00:37:25,460
And the pieces on the board

764
00:37:25,840 --> 00:37:27,770
are the common people themselves.

765
00:37:28,440 --> 00:37:29,590
Would you still say

766
00:37:29,630 --> 00:37:30,690
it doesn't matter?

767
00:37:39,620 --> 00:37:41,080
For the sake of the people,

768
00:37:42,930 --> 00:37:45,630
we cannot afford to lose.

769
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:48,710
So what if I become

770
00:37:48,710 --> 00:37:50,840
a pawn controlled by others?

771
00:37:51,760 --> 00:37:53,760
Even if I'm torn to pieces,

772
00:37:54,560 --> 00:37:56,950
I'll press on without hesitation.

773
00:38:22,060 --> 00:38:24,690
[Tianshu Pavilion]

774
00:38:22,880 --> 00:38:23,630
Li Si,

775
00:38:24,230 --> 00:38:26,760
you captured Prince Wenbu
in the Black Chest Case

776
00:38:26,760 --> 00:38:28,400
and averted a crisis
on Great Shi's borders.

777
00:38:28,130 --> 00:38:36,660
[Tianshu Pavilion]

778
00:38:28,710 --> 00:38:30,570
You deserve the greatest credit.

779
00:38:30,930 --> 00:38:31,960
Constable Frost and Constable Iron

780
00:38:31,960 --> 00:38:33,620
have also praised you highly.

781
00:38:34,320 --> 00:38:35,510
In recognition

782
00:38:35,510 --> 00:38:36,830
of your outstanding achievements,

783
00:38:36,830 --> 00:38:38,070
you are hereby promoted

784
00:38:38,070 --> 00:38:39,400
to Divine Constable of the Bureau.

785
00:38:38,950 --> 00:38:40,930
[Qingyang Divine Constable]

786
00:38:39,630 --> 00:38:42,090
You are granted
the Divine Constable Tally.

787
00:38:54,510 --> 00:38:56,010
Thank you, Chief.

788
00:38:55,940 --> 00:38:56,410
[Divine Constable Tally]

789
00:38:57,420 --> 00:38:58,990
[Qingyang Divine Constable]

790
00:39:02,080 --> 00:39:05,180
[Qingyang Divine Constable]

791
00:39:11,150 --> 00:39:18,240
[Tianshu Pavilion]

792
00:39:53,230 --> 00:39:55,960
Tianshu Pavilion holds
all the world's secrets.

793
00:39:56,510 --> 00:39:58,510
Its archives are organized

794
00:39:58,600 --> 00:40:01,400
according to the hidden codes
of heaven and earth.

795
00:40:03,040 --> 00:40:05,010
Section Jia records royal affairs

796
00:40:05,030 --> 00:40:06,890
and secrets of the imperial clan.

797
00:40:08,910 --> 00:40:11,280
Section Yi covers
criminal cases, cold cases,

798
00:40:11,280 --> 00:40:12,630
and martial-world vendettas.

799
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:15,020
[Heaven]

800
00:40:13,630 --> 00:40:15,510
Section Bing covers
astronomy and astrology,

801
00:40:15,060 --> 00:40:17,550
[Jiashen] [Jiawu] [Jiaxu]

802
00:40:15,760 --> 00:40:17,690
as well as geography and feng shui.

803
00:40:19,440 --> 00:40:20,440
And so on.

804
00:40:19,560 --> 00:40:20,610
[Bingyin] [Bingzi] [Bingxu] [Bingjia]

805
00:40:20,760 --> 00:40:21,500
[Water]

806
00:40:20,800 --> 00:40:22,480
The princes' hunt grounds,
year 20 of Hongyun,

807
00:40:22,300 --> 00:40:22,640
[Wind]

808
00:40:22,510 --> 00:40:23,810
the burning disaster.

809
00:40:23,830 --> 00:40:25,250
Jia represents imperial power,

810
00:40:25,250 --> 00:40:27,000
while Mao represents
the eastern spring wood,

811
00:40:27,000 --> 00:40:29,930
corresponding
to Mulan Hunting Ground's location.

812
00:40:34,710 --> 00:40:37,490
Even the shelves' arrangement
seems to mock the fact

813
00:40:37,490 --> 00:40:38,440
that Zhou Yan died

814
00:40:38,440 --> 00:40:40,900
in February,
when all things spring to life.

815
00:40:41,790 --> 00:40:44,730
[Imperial Secrets]

816
00:40:42,670 --> 00:40:43,360
That must be

817
00:40:43,360 --> 00:40:45,230
the imperial secret
on the Mao shelf in Section Jia.
